## Examples

### Simple Query

```graphql
query {
  user(id: "123") {
    id
    name
    email
    posts {
      id
      title
    }
  }
}
```

### Mutation

```graphql
mutation CreateUser {
  createUser(input: {
    name: "Alice"
    email: "alice@example.com"
  }) {
    id
    name
    email
  }
}
```

### Subscription

```graphql
subscription {
  userCreated {
    id
    name
    email
  }
}
```

